            "title": "Question: req.method",
            "id": 121770,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como você acessa o parâmetro de rota com o nome <code>name</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>req.method</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>req.params.name</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>req.route</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>req.path</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>req.params.name</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sua rota é <code>/users/:name</code>. Você solicita <code>/users/Maria?name=Lin</code>.</p><p>Qual valor <code>req.params.name</code> contém?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Maria</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Lin</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>/users/Maria</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>undefined</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>Maria</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2 - Copy - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 132659,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete a URL para incluir dois parâmetros de consulta.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"bash\" name=\"script.sh\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"http://localhost:3000/product?category=electronics&amp;brand=Samsung\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"|\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>?</code> seguido de <code>&amp;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Envie <code>electronics</code> como <code>category</code> e <code>Samsung</code> como <code>brand</code>, nessa ordem.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"bash\" name=\"script.sh\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"http://localhost:3000/product?category=electronics&amp;brand=Samsung\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"|\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>?</code> seguido de <code>category</code>, <code>&amp;</code> e finalmente <code>brand</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
