            "id": 121778,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como você acessa o parâmetro de consulta com o nome <code>path</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>req.hostname</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"true\"><code>req.query.path</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>req.host</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>req.route</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>req.query.path</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sua rota é <code>/files/:path</code>. Você solicita <code>/files/docs?path=images</code>.</p><p>Qual valor <code>req.query.path</code> contém?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>images</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>docs</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>path</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>undefined</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>images</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
